<title>USA: RightChoice says chooses Express Scripts.</title>
<headline>RightChoice says chooses Express Scripts.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>RightChoice Managed Care Inc, the for-profit unit of Blue Cross and Blue Shield of Missouri, chose Express Scripts Inc to manage the pharmacy benefits of RightChoice members, the companies said.</p>
<p>Terms of the three-year agreement, effective March 17, and covering about 500,000 members, were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Express Scripts is a pharmacy benefits management firm. RightChoice is the largest managed healthcare concern in Missouri.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
